{"_note":"speaker -> sentence -> file. Built by tools/voices.mjs.","voices":{"cole":"Reed (English (US))","hart":"Daniel","hobbs":"Grandpa (English (US))","pryce":"Ralph","vivienne":"Moira","billie":"Karen","lindqvist":"Daniel","julian":"Reed (English (UK))","ox":"Ralph","tamsin":"Tessa","clementine":"Shelley (English (UK))","cylinder":"Shelley (English (US))"},"lines":{"cole":{"Morning, Chief.":"cole/d696e9a32217.m4a","Well, I wouldn't call it morning, exactly.":"cole/868f4f026658.m4a","You can't see the sun for all this dust.":"cole/14f512ce8ea8.m4a","Chief.":"cole/e48e7ef06457.m4a","The coffee's terrible, but at least it's hot.":"cole/772076967eb2.m4a","There you are, Chief.":"cole/f154c7b4ff30.m4a","Anything you need?":"cole/5a630e06f138.m4a","The wind's taken another shingle off the roof.":"cole/bc1bbae69ca7.m4a","What can I do for you?":"cole/e95288ddceb7.m4a","Back again, Chief?":"cole/09ca70ca6717.m4a","I've been staring at that board so long it's starting to stare back.":"cole/e198b23e64c7.m4a","Cole here.":"cole/571eedee8dee.m4a","Go ahead, Chief.":"cole/68c8d322ecc4.m4a","I hear you, Chief.":"cole/dc1970378e18.m4a","Mostly.":"cole/d1c2e79d15db.m4a","This storm's chewing up the signal.":"cole/fecdba961829.m4a","Here's where we stand, Chief.":"cole/89d36865f9bc.m4a","Cornelius Pryce, the man who owns this airfield, was found dead this morning, locked inside his office in the hangar.":"cole/71d7b1d0607e.m4a","Nobody can leave.":"cole/c417bb8889b1.m4a","The dust storm has grounded every plane, and the road's buried.":"cole/f2bd5ee2c565.m4a","It should clear around half past five this evening.":"cole/64740209205c.m4a","When it does, everyone flies home, including whoever killed him.":"cole/8a60ee9cb1b4.m4a","So we've got until then to work out who did it, how they did it, and why.":"cole/ac5a34eafa31.m4a","We've still got until about half past five, Chief.":"cole/d25421d3191f.m4a","Every bit of evidence you find goes up on the board here, and you can read everything we've got in the case file.":"cole/eb76d0c58bc6.m4a","Press J for it anytime.":"cole/15d519c4efb0.m4a","Who do you want to know about?":"cole/942af74ed153.m4a","Cornelius Pryce.":"cole/cb22ef2fea5b.m4a","Sixty-two.":"cole/5f9e243eed98.m4a","He built Pryce Transcontinental Air from nothing.":"cole/7752c155b9d8.m4a","Charming, loved a big show, and used to getting his own way.":"cole/53345a6bea10.m4a","He's the one who's dead.":"cole/fbee3f3526d1.m4a","Vivienne Pryce, his wife.":"cole/408f6b7ff3d3.m4a","Used to be an actress on the stage.":"cole/135f28e91f85.m4a","Very elegant, very sharp tongue.":"cole/bb90fc296b11.m4a","She calls everybody 'darling', and I don't think she means it.":"cole/28ebd7389135.m4a","Captain Billie Strand, the company's pilot.":"cole/7841eb5a3b86.m4a","Loud, funny, a bit superstitious.":"cole/11f1bbb7069b.m4a","She has burn scars on her hands, and she clams up if you mention the Marigold.":"cole/dc2e85ecdd33.m4a","Doctor Lindqvist, Pryce's physician.":"cole/f3b124ad2ede.m4a","Gentle, nervous, very careful.":"cole/7cf8cb002e40.m4a","His hands shake.":"cole/e54852de020b.m4a","He's the one who examined the body this morning.":"cole/d6c9144149bc.m4a","Julian Ferreira-Blake.":"cole/c5fbcc176f78.m4a","He's from Meridian Air, the rival airline.":"cole/ca02d5d58bcc.m4a","Smooth, very polite, never raises his voice.":"cole/3064e048081f.m4a","He hums opera when he thinks no one's listening.":"cole/60e93e27467f.m4a","Abel Brennan, but everyone calls him Ox.":"cole/921ba96ae144.m4a","The mechanic.":"cole/ae88850ed45e.m4a","Huge fellow, but gentle, slow to speak, goes to church.":"cole/e19cc93035cf.m4a","Keeps pigeons.":"cole/3036eef05a83.m4a","I'd bet he's a terrible liar.":"cole/b1def85420f8.m4a","Tamsin Quill, Pryce's secretary.":"cole/ae68a7098627.m4a","Blunt, smokes like a chimney, and says straight out that she hated him.":"cole/63bec936721e.m4a","Either very honest or very clever.":"cole/91cb37349128.m4a","Walter Hobbs runs the radio.":"cole/7a2b3cffaa34.m4a","Old fellow, kind, a bit hard of hearing, and he wanders off the subject.":"cole/f9c074f0b72a.m4a","He thinks the radio wires are haunted.":"cole/94f8630ea381.m4a","He met us at the hangar last night.":"cole/d09ba52913c1.m4a","Right now?":"cole/6c099b81e512.m4a","Get to know the place, Chief.":"cole/4d27b84f8d82.m4a","Walk around, see who's where, and come back here when you've found something.":"cole/788184938411.m4a","Anything you find goes on the board.":"cole/f5ddda798e76.m4a","Have a look around the airfield and talk to people when they're about.":"cole/319c7a785060.m4a","The reports on my desk will fill in some background as the day goes on.":"cole/460159f91d54.m4a","Here's how I see it, Chief.":"cole/bd5b8fd61e4a.m4a","Okay.":"cole/c5fbb27e2910.m4a","Don't laugh.":"cole/a60b9429dce2.m4a","If it were my case, which, thank God, it isn't...":"cole/06444ee15ba5.m4a","Want me to spell it out a bit more?":"cole/3e9349e1eb0d.m4a","It'll cost us a few more minutes.":"cole/8fb23a909e7c.m4a","That's everything I've got on that one, Chief.":"cole/c139b9338dc5.m4a","The rest is up to you.":"cole/f1d53c2b9e49.m4a","Honestly?":"cole/f5da31bac6e7.m4a","I think we've done all we can for now.":"cole/d2ea75c961e9.m4a","Nothing new yet.":"cole/76a7f45187d9.m4a","I'll keep the wire warm.":"cole/34d25de394e6.m4a","Right behind you, Chief.":"cole/2aeae775ec93.m4a","I'll wait right here.":"cole/de3692c7ba95.m4a","I won't wander off.":"cole/ca6b2674d549.m4a","Back to the shed, then.":"cole/3b3d268656e4.m4a","I'll keep the stove going.":"cole/0ec663f6267f.m4a","On my way, Chief.":"cole/5bb35e65681d.m4a","Give me a minute to find you in this soup.":"cole/d0e902df50fc.m4a","Chief, it's three o'clock.":"cole/e8b1f56ec9dd.m4a","Storm's due to lift around half past five.":"cole/9d6e62ccf10a.m4a","Then everybody flies home, including whoever did this.":"cole/f903c2114690.m4a","One hour left, Chief.":"cole/e54bf2668fc9.m4a","If we're going to file a theory, now's the time.":"cole/b78b60313292.m4a","Chief, that's not a heart-attack face.":"cole/aaf6d92adce1.m4a","Bolted from inside.":"cole/fbfbfb35f93f.m4a","So how did anybody get out?":"cole/a0b683ce6193.m4a","A kid's music box?":"cole/7cb0018ff26f.m4a","In his office?":"cole/4efee229e735.m4a","Zürich at five in the morning.":"cole/b0f3fd87a5d7.m4a","Two passengers.":"cole/093d7acc8d88.m4a","Who was the second one?":"cole/98453ff8225c.m4a","So it wasn't Pryce who sent for us.":"cole/f894d8fba645.m4a","Then who did?":"cole/68401ed8d41e.m4a","Small hands.":"cole/6330c82e0d18.m4a","Scarred.":"cole/af425c7c144e.m4a","Nobody at that dinner has hands like that.":"cole/3a6180afb03e.m4a","Six on the manifest, five certificates...":"cole/4b1d62c49ca2.m4a","Chief, that's not a clerical error.":"cole/330769a50ca7.m4a","Pinning it up on the board, Chief.":"cole/407941f0f524.m4a","Bolted from the inside, Chief.":"cole/721a0a193203.m4a","A way in through the floor.":"cole/0a3c8e2e3680.m4a","That changes everything.":"cole/211a48cbea94.m4a","Half past nine to quarter past ten.":"cole/0d59a44cbfad.m4a","Now we know when to ask everyone where they were.":"cole/cd225e3006d6.m4a","Somebody poisoned him.":"cole/0f731c358587.m4a","Cyanide in the decanter.":"cole/4abb52e00f8a.m4a","Anyone who could get into that room could have done it.":"cole/223e35fb4a26.m4a","Somebody wound that music box after he was dead.":"cole/5df782feb531.m4a","Who, and why?":"cole/e4fa3e619cba.m4a","So the 'gunshot' was an engine.":"cole/9eb929e5e491.m4a","One less thing to chase.":"cole/d621dcfd21bb.m4a","He was going to confess.":"cole/650de1d5792f.m4a","That's a motive for half the people at that dinner.":"cole/ffb950336cfe.m4a","Miss Quill was squeezing him.":"cole/e4203901e55b.m4a","That's ugly, Chief, but blackmailers want their mark alive.":"cole/83ad11a2af28.m4a","Every way out checked and on film.":"cole/dcaae3e163e4.m4a","Only the floor's left, Chief.":"cole/3f0c73b9b94f.m4a","Pink skin and bitter almonds.":"cole/3550f57345fc.m4a","I read about that in a manual once.":"cole/bb8458402627.m4a","Cyanide.":"cole/c58e596cb59f.m4a","So the music box was playing after he died.":"cole/2b4ff48644fc.m4a","That gives me goosebumps, Chief.":"cole/efb9c37f91df.m4a","Prussian blue.":"cole/353c770b572b.m4a","That's cyanide, all right.":"cole/e2a903224a47.m4a","In the decanter.":"cole/e31bf885d60f.m4a","Four people's secrets in one tin box.":"cole/7ef860abe921.m4a","He kept everyone on a leash, didn't he?":"cole/3b30299da481.m4a","A trapdoor.":"cole/47cbb2256245.m4a","Chief, there's something under this airfield.":"cole/710b409ca03c.m4a","Get some rest, Chief.":"cole/ab657768326b.m4a","I'll wake you in half an hour.":"cole/5c98ce9f6a7e.m4a","Rise and shine, Chief.":"cole/860ba3616456.m4a","Half an hour, like I promised.":"cole/173f17dd295f.m4a","Not yet, Chief.":"cole/2819cbac8089.m4a","When we've got the who, the how, the where and the why, I'll type it up and we'll file it.":"cole/d90b27be2221.m4a","That's the fingerprint kit, Chief: powder, brushes and the good magnifying glass.":"cole/712823918c5e.m4a","Bring me something to dust.":"cole/94254be75d08.m4a","We'll need some hard facts before we can pin the night down.":"cole/d6045274bb51.m4a","Right now it's all 'about nine-ish'.":"cole/5e66c0cad97e.m4a","There's 1 new on the desk, Chief.":"cole/9cef174dee2d.m4a","Typed up nice and neat.":"cole/31d92b373a88.m4a","Don't spill anything on them.":"cole/0a23aa73088d.m4a","There's 2 new on the desk, Chief.":"cole/d899e1903f8d.m4a","There's 3 new on the desk, Chief.":"cole/b9543468095a.m4a","There's 4 new on the desk, Chief.":"cole/40a2f222fa71.m4a","There's 5 new on the desk, Chief.":"cole/12908702e672.m4a","There's 6 new on the desk, Chief.":"cole/1f2204dc5aef.m4a","There's 7 new on the desk, Chief.":"cole/32256b4a3ad6.m4a","There's 8 new on the desk, Chief.":"cole/521235f4a6c8.m4a","There's 9 new on the desk, Chief.":"cole/3403ab9a9ccd.m4a","Anything else, Chief?":"cole/c12b80fcdb1b.m4a","What else?":"cole/40ba5a3328aa.m4a","Sure.":"cole/29179422c741.m4a","Any time, Chief.":"cole/80549795b2b7.m4a","Before anything gets moved, Chief, check every way in or out of that office: the door bolt, the window, the stove pipe, the ceiling, the floor vent and the floor itself.":"cole/24a63d3ec958.m4a","Mark each one possible or impossible.":"cole/a62d6f7f1982.m4a","Try the bolt with a bit of thread, look at the window bars and the stove pipe, and knock on the floor.":"cole/bf588c662b49.m4a","Only one of those six could let a person through.":"cole/11537dba8437.m4a","Use your camera plates on the things that matter: the body, the desk, the bolt, the note.":"cole/f3c46e2900e0.m4a","The door bolt, the window, the stove pipe, the ceiling and the vent are all impossible.":"cole/db5f3501e621.m4a","The floor is the only one you should mark possible.":"cole/c8a87690313e.m4a","Doctor Lindqvist will talk you through the body, Chief, but watch what he skips.":"cole/847243b22e85.m4a","Look at everything yourself.":"cole/1ade946dde69.m4a","Heart failure doesn't turn skin pink or leave a smell on the breath.":"cole/322bf452497e.m4a","Check the skin, the settled blood and the mouth.":"cole/530f37895588.m4a","The three things that don't fit a heart attack: the cherry-pink settled blood, the faint bitter-almond smell at the mouth, and the pink colour of his skin and nails.":"cole/d124f50be356.m4a","Bodies cool at roughly one and a half degrees an hour, Chief.":"cole/ae233a0b74f2.m4a","Work backwards from the thermometer reading.":"cole/4880b3193bd5.m4a","Normal is 98.6.":"cole/befde31288db.m4a","Take away the reading, divide by 1.5, and count back from the time you took it.":"cole/53ce43ffcd6c.m4a","Then check the stiffness and the settled blood agree.":"cole/023be82acd4c.m4a","He was 85.0 at seven o'clock: that's about nine hours of cooling, so around ten to ten last night.":"cole/49620410bb33.m4a","Set the window from half past nine to quarter past ten.":"cole/c06faa357452.m4a","Six drops of test chemical, four samples, Chief.":"cole/eadd04f00290.m4a","Don't waste drops before you know what each chemical shows.":"cole/b63c98ccad8a.m4a","You need the chart that says which chemical reacts to what.":"cole/c0b1e9b20123.m4a","Ask the doctor nicely, use my reference book, or force the kit open.":"cole/ae652950fc86.m4a","Put chemical B on the decanter brandy and on the glass: deep blue means cyanide.":"cole/4ea29c669a44.m4a","The heart drops go brown with C, but that's only his medicine.":"cole/94fcb56b70c7.m4a","Pryce loved riddles.":"cole/d48f991403b4.m4a","The combination is three numbers, and the answers are on the office walls and in his pocket.":"cole/80f3e4e1fd93.m4a","'Her years' is the age written under the girl in the photograph, 'the wings' hearts' is the number of engines on the plane in the picture, and 'the minute the sky stopped' is on his stopped pocket watch.":"cole/d766cee818ba.m4a","Nineteen, three, seventeen: left to nineteen, right to three, left to seventeen.":"cole/fdb03d84c4d2.m4a","Knock on the floor, Chief, and listen.":"cole/49f417014ec5.m4a","Then listen to that music box all the way through.":"cole/4065f211eb94.m4a","The hollow spot is under the rug.":"cole/88a5a4c5704b.m4a","The music box has numbered teeth, and the bookshelf has eight pull-books.":"cole/0c482d8662b0.m4a","Each note of the tune is a book.":"cole/8a873948642d.m4a","Pull the books in this order: five, three, one, three, five, eight, five, three.":"cole/b1b29369bace.m4a","The Trimotor in the hangar was being got ready for a flight, Chief.":"cole/ca9b239f69fb.m4a","Climb into the cabin and look around.":"cole/f5370f688c41.m4a","Look at everything: the cot, the straps, the trunk, the hat box, and the flight plan in the cockpit.":"cole/bb1c80df0417.m4a","A stretcher with straps, a woman's trunk for 'E.":"cole/8bf37ed5286b.m4a","Marsh', and a plan for Zürich at five.":"cole/5dd162399528.m4a","It was readied for a passenger lying down, sedated.":"cole/fb9c32d53115.m4a","The darkroom storeroom in Operations has a stock ledger, Chief.":"cole/f09b2bb56b9e.m4a","Weigh the jars and see what's missing.":"cole/a439388d7a9a.m4a","Two jars are light.":"cole/34f2b3c573c4.m4a","Check the darkroom log: one of them has a good reason.":"cole/bac1edbf2d41.m4a","The cyanide is thirty grams short with nothing in the log.":"cole/a522ae2b6e75.m4a","The silver nitrate was used for plates.":"cole/065494db1b35.m4a","Billie's old plates from the 1931 search are in the darkroom.":"cole/f8447a3891d7.m4a","Develop them carefully: you only get one retry each.":"cole/c9f1b2170ff5.m4a","Expose when the needle is in the green band, and pull the plate out of the developer at about sixty seconds.":"cole/377072edc781.m4a","Then compare plate four with the official photo.":"cole/92ff6da8922a.m4a","On plate four: the truck tracks, the drag trail, and the bundle under the canvas aren't in the official photo.":"cole/bfe074c6b5d9.m4a","The records room in Operations has the Marigold's passenger cards, Chief.":"cole/453015d5140a.m4a","Count the dead.":"cole/44787d573277.m4a","Put the six cards in seat order, then match each to a death certificate.":"cole/a546742a64d0.m4a","One won't have one.":"cole/61e6f33559d6.m4a","Seat four, C.":"cole/0301cadf37f7.m4a","Pryce, nineteen: paid for, never certified dead.":"cole/8b1d065bb844.m4a","The lounge fireplace in Operations is still warm, Chief.":"cole/393dc1f55634.m4a","Somebody burned papers before dawn.":"cole/a458753ac4d5.m4a","Move the lamp slowly around each sheet.":"cole/ade785a51f00.m4a","Each line only shows at its own angle.":"cole/cd933adb8b3f.m4a","The letter is Vivienne leaving him, not killing him.":"cole/604cb2abe5e4.m4a","The contract page has Julian's forged signature.":"cole/795bb6e391fd.m4a","The hangar lights went out at noon, Chief.":"cole/de625423894d.m4a","The fuse panel's in the maintenance shed.":"cole/07bfefc60cd3.m4a","The hangar, the radio and the beacon must be on.":"cole/3c748901df3a.m4a","Don't overload either generator.":"cole/e65f8668f84b.m4a","Hangar and beacon on generator 1, radio and the Quarters on generator 2.":"cole/fc242a5a4976.m4a","Then look under the panel.":"cole/48f704bdbcbc.m4a","Ox's old engine mounts are in the maintenance shed.":"cole/db4585afd939.m4a","Test them for cracks.":"cole/8a4f9b9be976.m4a","Dye, wait, wipe, developer: in that order.":"cole/bceceef21d91.m4a","Straight parallel lines are machining marks.":"cole/9e3f7f293a0b.m4a","Mount 2, the Marigold's: the jagged branching line is a real crack.":"cole/66f9aa2c9385.m4a","Compare the ration ledger in the storage shed with the mess roster, Chief.":"cole/9589b178bea8.m4a","Day by day.":"cole/3eaddd4cea0c.m4a","Take the people fed away from the rations signed out.":"cole/5de7f82dc7f5.m4a","Then turn back through the ledger pages to see when it started.":"cole/ed293a4043a0.m4a","It's one extra ration every day, signed by Ox, starting 12 November 1931.":"cole/ec31f6e24d49.m4a","Those scuffs in the dust are where the crates usually sit, Chief.":"cole/e2a2f9f9cfc2.m4a","Somebody moves them every day.":"cole/3ddfc51bb0c8.m4a","Push the crates back onto the curved marks.":"cole/32e104f4200a.m4a","You can only push, never pull, so don't trap one against a wall.":"cole/f29f8f3cfc72.m4a","Push the two top crates into the top corners, and walk the bottom-left one around to the bottom-right corner.":"cole/5e6242007791.m4a","Read every fuel gauge yourself, Chief, before you believe the ledger.":"cole/c8e8e63ca0e2.m4a","Compare today's reading with yesterday's, then check what Ox logged as issued.":"cole/c37f7f18baba.m4a","Tank C, the Trimotor's, is 38 gallons short with nothing logged.":"cole/72b544f2fd60.m4a","Then look at the Waco's fuel cap.":"cole/e8e5a804e9b4.m4a","If there's a tunnel under the field, smoke will find it.":"cole/3aeb0934a9d5.m4a","There's a rusty vent pipe in the fuel farm yard, and smoke pots in the maintenance shed.":"cole/2b635aae6b83.m4a","Take a smoke pot from the maintenance shed, light it in the vent pipe at the fuel farm, then go look in the hangar office, the storage shed and the darkroom.":"cole/880c8f0f8399.m4a","You have about forty minutes.":"cole/235f00c4eed5.m4a","The smoke comes up through the office floor vent, the storage shed floor and the darkroom storeroom.":"cole/40aa7ea9f767.m4a","Visit all three while it lasts.":"cole/bfbcbfc6e6e2.m4a","Hobbs says someone has been tapping on the telegraph line.":"cole/b4a51944111a.m4a","Listen to the telegram tape at his radio, Chief.":"cole/b720af0b5d32.m4a","Compare the tape with each operator's sending: the speed, how even it is, and the stumble on the Q.":"cole/74c263ab161a.m4a","Then follow the iron posts across the runway.":"cole/679fd38837aa.m4a","It's the unknown sender.":"cole/60faec6701b2.m4a","The posts lead to a splice box by the maintenance shed, and the wire goes under the hangar wall.":"cole/5fd88b0d55f8.m4a","Hobbs kept his original barograph traces.":"cole/0822e5bc0ead.m4a","Lay the 1931 one over the official report.":"cole/a21ded757aa3.m4a","Slide the tracing until the time marks line up, then look at the letter 'e' in the report under the magnifier.":"cole/2003f11c717b.m4a","Line it up at about 37.":"cole/5cb4b6281af2.m4a","The chipped 'e' is Miss Quill's typewriter.":"cole/db1bc7213065.m4a","Hobbs kept a recording of the Marigold's last call.":"cole/c042825c22d0.m4a","Listen to it all the way to the end.":"cole/04bf7d9c180f.m4a","The interesting part is near the end, after the engine screams.":"cole/379d9d5687c8.m4a","Scrub to about two minutes forty.":"cole/64adad3c043e.m4a","Mark it at around 2:40 to 2:48.":"cole/d6d7fc8d8634.m4a","It's a young woman calling 'Daddy'.":"cole/56b6f40e5774.m4a","The beacon keeper's log mentions a glow from the hangar roof at dusk.":"cole/fdf4c4b0ae31.m4a","Go up the tower at half past four.":"cole/955de42574cd.m4a","Wait for dusk, then sweep the binoculars along the hangar roof slowly.":"cole/2a8bfb6f50dd.m4a","The glow is at the roof vent, a little right of centre.":"cole/d9f1cab024fc.m4a","Stop on it and say 'There!'.":"cole/ccc34923792f.m4a","Doctor Lindqvist's case is in his room in the Quarters.":"cole/9931bd36d5d2.m4a","He'll open it if he trusts you; otherwise I can get a warrant.":"cole/09e5e90db4a3.m4a","If you pick it: light tension only, and try each pin until one clicks.":"cole/705309c4e2b4.m4a","Heavy tension breaks picks.":"cole/79a7b916cc24.m4a","The pins set in the order three, one, four, two, with light tension.":"cole/15616de4d15d.m4a","Dust the things from the office and compare them with everyone's prints, Chief.":"cole/1bb6e7135dc2.m4a","Pattern, width and scars all have to match.":"cole/3132571711a9.m4a","Use the callipers to measure each print.":"cole/e4c484796f3c.m4a","A loop is a little U shape, a whorl goes round in circles, an arch is a hump.":"cole/7453db2dbf56.m4a","His glass is his own print.":"cole/1d03e3289de2.m4a","The decanter and the music box carry a small scarred loop, thirteen millimetres: that matches nobody at the dinner.":"cole/95cf1a2522e4.m4a","Billie's is scarred but sixteen.":"cole/158114ee3db8.m4a","Tamsin's ledger is in a cipher, Chief.":"cole/a014436a1480.m4a","Every letter stands for another.":"cole/fb8e7db4ebaf.m4a","It's a keyword alphabet.":"cole/f17478785af8.m4a","The keyword is a name everyone keeps saying.":"cole/946967919f07.m4a","The keyword is MARIGOLD.":"cole/c46585673405.m4a","Put the night in order, Chief.":"cole/59587ce075a3.m4a","Start from the fixed points: the bolt at 21:25, the tune at ten, the door at 06:10.":"cole/8e2f0c0668f8.m4a","Every card needs something you've actually found.":"cole/15ae608ad317.m4a","Talk to Billie about the bang, Julian about where he was, and solve the time of death.":"cole/cb3e39a3e99d.m4a","Dinner, the bolt, his death, the tune, the bang, Julian at the door, the note, the door broken down.":"cole/d9b1addfa251.m4a","In that order.":"cole/65331810689e.m4a","Chief, I can't see the ground.":"cole/dca0cdb4fb7b.m4a","We're down.":"cole/e368f2727f7c.m4a","We're actually down.":"cole/0aa23931b2d5.m4a","I'm never complaining about trains again.":"cole/6a17f9366b14.m4a"},"hart":{"Inspector Hart.":"hart/fc3527b2eeb9.m4a","Come to Sable Flat.":"hart/4108bc3d99af.m4a","The truth about the Marigold.":"hart/3fe5d90e3974.m4a","Tell no one.":"hart/fd1b173de9c4.m4a","C.":"hart/3b5494dd996d.m4a","Pryce.":"hart/1193ad6817a0.m4a","Neither can the ground see us.":"hart/56abf6ad6aa5.m4a","Clementine Pryce climbs the iron rungs at noon with her gloved hands in front of her, and Danny puts the cuffs on gently.":"hart/c9a2ff726ac2.m4a","The trial is in Reno in the spring.":"hart/9c975bfed362.m4a","The papers call her 'the Ghost of Sable Flat'.":"hart/1385d449902c.m4a","They print the real weather report, the cracked mount, the insurer's money.":"hart/4adf07d266ad.m4a","Tamsin Quill, Abel Brennan, Doctor Lindqvist and Julian Ferreira-Blake are all charged in the matter of the Marigold.":"hart/2beda6061d3e.m4a","Clementine is convicted.":"hart/78fe05612e0b.m4a","On the day of the sentence she asks the judge if she may see the sky first.":"hart/86648eead97f.m4a","He says yes.":"hart/803c3831612a.m4a","You keep the music box.":"hart/3072c9e58b22.m4a","Some nights you wind it.":"hart/58697ff60342.m4a","You rule the death natural causes, heart failure, and sign it in your neatest hand.":"hart/1d6b0d1b91bd.m4a","Danny watches you do it and doesn't say a word.":"hart/8a7c8b9456cd.m4a","At dawn the Trimotor takes off into a clean sky with Billie at the controls, Lindqvist in the cabin, and a girl in a veiled hat looking out of the window.":"hart/04f8a85f3e90.m4a","Everyone else drives away free.":"hart/096d63785983.m4a","The Marigold stays a crash and nothing more.":"hart/d5c82bcb7932.m4a","Years later, postcards start arriving from Zürich.":"hart/7983d5e52612.m4a","No name.":"hart/7980a35a62dd.m4a","Always a little aeroplane drawn in the corner.":"hart/0e53aa6b51bc.m4a","You carry it alone.":"hart/d0d1b9e09746.m4a","That was always the price of silence.":"hart/9c42326f8457.m4a","You bring her up the ladder and out through the hangar doors, and for the first time in seven hundred and thirty-three days Clementine Pryce stands in the sun.":"hart/70cdc242907b.m4a","The storm has gone.":"hart/45c03e087838.m4a","She shades her eyes and laughs at the wrong moment.":"hart/6363ce21d5e8.m4a","At the trial her diary is read aloud, and Billie's 1931 photographs are passed along the jury box: the truck at the wreck before the rescuers, the stretcher under the canvas.":"hart/a24fa0b0e1c7.m4a","The Marigold truth comes out all at once: the order to fly, the false weather, the cracked mount, the buried inquiry.":"hart/e39bee97c76a.m4a","It ruins everyone who kept the silence.":"hart/05b887438673.m4a","Clementine is acquitted.":"hart/735b0486656a.m4a","She learns to fly.":"hart/c5176e1b73bc.m4a","The last postcard you get from her is of an aeroplane over the Alps.":"hart/130fbb6bb94f.m4a","On the back: 'Found.'":"hart/8961dcab6228.m4a","You name the wrong person, and the evidence, such as it is, is enough for a jury that wants an answer.":"hart/7a8fe0d02cf3.m4a","At dusk the storm lifts and the Trimotor leaves with Billie at the controls and a passenger nobody counted.":"hart/47537c81daef.m4a","Under the hangar, a lantern burns out and is not lit again.":"hart/6dd10d2fa2cd.m4a","Years later you still dream about a music box playing in a locked room.":"hart/46cb52ee9ee1.m4a","Half past five.":"hart/cba94167e9b1.m4a","The storm clears, the strip is open, and nobody needs your permission to leave.":"hart/e7a1a817fcb6.m4a","By nightfall Sable Flat is empty.":"hart/bff4065d9966.m4a","The case goes cold, and stays cold.":"hart/e40df7ad5175.m4a","The last thing you see as your plane climbs away is the hangar, a single lamp glowing under the roof vent, and a small silhouette at the window, watching you go.":"hart/8832045de301.m4a","You bring her up into the daylight before you can prove what was done to her.":"hart/b5c5aa8c617b.m4a","Without the photographs and the papers, the trial is about one poisoned decanter and nothing else.":"hart/b38a767a35cc.m4a","The Marigold stays buried.":"hart/fd21065760c6.m4a","Clementine Pryce is convicted.":"hart/d699f39e6d1a.m4a","The people who made her keep their secrets.":"hart/ad6963322d5c.m4a"},"hobbs":{"Mr.":"hobbs/936eb989684c.m4a","Pryce said you'd come.":"hobbs/456adec83248.m4a","He didn't say the storm would, too.":"hobbs/b95647620d45.m4a","Eh?":"hobbs/213ff93713f6.m4a","Oh, Inspector!":"hobbs/b9f1e7aae9da.m4a","Come in out of the dust.":"hobbs/c1212e0cff45.m4a","Mind the wires.":"hobbs/86e0b6f04d06.m4a","Inspector!":"hobbs/35a0db5fb4aa.m4a","Have you come about the ghost?":"hobbs/17c0c920b5d9.m4a","Not me, Inspector.":"hobbs/b63c52a86137.m4a","The key was cold when I came in.":"hobbs/4234a03718bb.m4a","But someone sent it from this line, and sent it slow and even, like a pupil.":"hobbs/8650d94f7093.m4a","I always fumble my Q.":"hobbs/17720e242609.m4a","They copied that.":"hobbs/b5f9eea1ea3f.m4a","Tapping in the wires.":"hobbs/c475008f5947.m4a","Months of it.":"hobbs/af33d0fb7ce9.m4a","Late at night, little messages, like someone learning.":"hobbs/c6f4916bf31b.m4a","I thought it was the Marigold's ghost come home.":"hobbs/9f11cfa3ff69.m4a","That old waltz?":"hobbs/3d1f2251b2f3.m4a","Pryce taught it to his girl when she was small.":"hobbs/7e752e547006.m4a","Five, three, one, three, five, eight, five, three, that's how he counted it on the keys.":"hobbs/37afd403ac40.m4a","Always the same.":"hobbs/c72750689c03.m4a","The old fuel culvert runs right under it.":"hobbs/94d84cd0c77b.m4a","Draughty as a church.":"hobbs/5fbd99dcb3e5.m4a","You can hear the wind in it some nights.":"hobbs/166c774a4999.m4a","Or something.":"hobbs/6cf203a18e1c.m4a","Lightning took the arrestor around half past ten.":"hobbs/2885fab06d8f.m4a","I reset it myself.":"hobbs/3d7aa1ddb4c5.m4a","Nobody asked me, so I didn't say.":"hobbs/fb6ef0bcf83b.m4a","Every dusk there's a glow under the hangar roof vent.":"hobbs/4739c4e4484b.m4a","Like somebody lighting a lamp below the floor.":"hobbs/1186314daae5.m4a","Ghost lights, I always said.":"hobbs/eb7855d875f1.m4a","Every one, Inspector.":"hobbs/ee094dfc7879.m4a","The Marigold's last call: I wrote down a girl's voice at the very end.":"hobbs/904bf6e72ad5.m4a","'Daddy, I can see the ridge.' The inquiry said I was mistaken.":"hobbs/0c1db2e04112.m4a","I wasn't.":"hobbs/aec2a9bdf1bd.m4a","Under the office?":"hobbs/a82114537dcd.m4a","Well I never.":"hobbs/e5573a7ac051.m4a","Then the tapping... no.":"hobbs/5ca0d9d910a4.m4a","No, that's ghost talk.":"hobbs/7c9d212f89c9.m4a","Speak up, Inspector.":"hobbs/0c0f282fa3d2.m4a","Oh, that.":"hobbs/802bde9f2d72.m4a","Can't say I know.":"hobbs/1f7fc94a656c.m4a","What do you want to know?":"hobbs/9619ea597b92.m4a","Anything else, Inspector?":"hobbs/69ca318a1ebe.m4a","Anything else?":"hobbs/8dcc2de2d9c0.m4a","I'd rather not talk about that.":"hobbs/00cad0dfe42a.m4a","Not with you.":"hobbs/596cf10852a0.m4a","Not yet.":"hobbs/b10a234d0c69.m4a","Inspector?":"hobbs/e882ef3270dd.m4a","What do you want to show them?":"hobbs/38eeea865154.m4a","You haven't found anything worth showing yet.":"hobbs/82eeb135d4a8.m4a"},"pryce":{"To Marigold.":"pryce/5646f4c5a174.m4a","May she forgive me.":"pryce/b1f5018cb357.m4a"},"vivienne":{"Inspector, darling.":"vivienne/d8ffd74ef000.m4a","Come to watch the widow weep?":"vivienne/e8612b6b5d00.m4a","I'm afraid I'm not very good at it.":"vivienne/ba7b5cf34857.m4a","Back again, Inspector?":"vivienne/3c530f6238d1.m4a","I'm flattered.":"vivienne/358e3ea19a59.m4a","In my room with a book I wasn't reading.":"vivienne/00648882ad24.m4a","At ten o'clock I heard his music box through the wall of the hangar office.":"vivienne/8d863180cef8.m4a","Cornelius never played it.":"vivienne/e467a77d9ddb.m4a","Never.":"vivienne/9bd0e8feb161.m4a","He couldn't bear to.":"vivienne/6c8bf8f9ba7d.m4a","We were a magnificent marriage, Inspector.":"vivienne/74ef1362e0dd.m4a","On paper.":"vivienne/c5a27cfd942e.m4a","In person we were two people sharing a very large house and a very long silence.":"vivienne/978ca79fcde9.m4a","His daughter.":"vivienne/6675e145f813.m4a","From before me.":"vivienne/b2efe8bde9c2.m4a","She died on the Marigold in 1931.":"vivienne/96de90788c5f.m4a","He never forgave himself, and he never let anyone say her name.":"vivienne/4a046cf7fdc9.m4a","The airline's pride, until it flew into Raven Ridge in a storm the weather report swore wasn't there.":"vivienne/843cef9b9789.m4a","Six aboard.":"vivienne/448539ae3ecc.m4a","Cornelius bought the newspapers' silence along with everything else.":"vivienne/3bf5f87a8923.m4a","So someone else wound it.":"vivienne/131993a1cf85.m4a","Someone who knew it was there.":"vivienne/972d7dca07f8.m4a","Do you understand what that means?":"vivienne/637a6c1b13ab.m4a","Because I'm beginning to.":"vivienne/6998279104ea.m4a","Yes, I was leaving him.":"vivienne/bb360a56cc2f.m4a","'By Saturday we shall be free of him.' Free, Inspector.":"vivienne/29c4e7fe229f.m4a","Not rid.":"vivienne/da3dce50c046.m4a","I had a train ticket, not a bottle of poison.":"vivienne/987ed61f99f0.m4a","Poison.":"vivienne/e38cb75881b5.m4a","How very theatrical.":"vivienne/7ab4ef7f7c50.m4a","He'd have hated that it wasn't his heart.":"vivienne/35b75254405c.m4a","He was so proud of his heart.":"vivienne/a65cf33159d2.m4a","Fascinating, darling.":"vivienne/59840eaf1127.m4a","Is it supposed to mean something to me?":"vivienne/04324a905b9b.m4a","What do you want to know?":"vivienne/ac84f02cd82d.m4a","Anything else, Inspector?":"vivienne/61e2bb883d15.m4a","Anything else?":"vivienne/8b29db7ea455.m4a","I'd rather not talk about that.":"vivienne/2a59a15a6f9b.m4a","Not with you.":"vivienne/68841f6bd78d.m4a","Not yet.":"vivienne/6ffc3fe41368.m4a","Inspector?":"vivienne/950e82515c96.m4a","What do you want to show them?":"vivienne/1ad812e1b55c.m4a","You haven't found anything worth showing yet.":"vivienne/e2c8a34581b6.m4a"},"billie":{"Inspector.":"billie/35ee32e4118a.m4a","If you're here to tell me not to touch anything, I already broke the door down.":"billie/45e8c1307b9e.m4a","With an axe.":"billie/08e5532fcf54.m4a","You again.":"billie/93fe69930cb6.m4a","Fine.":"billie/7932131bc321.m4a","What?":"billie/08b779516cf8.m4a","He didn't answer at six.":"billie/c38c0e5b0710.m4a","The door wouldn't budge, so I got the fire axe.":"billie/cb5a2a0ae914.m4a","When I got it open the bolt was still thrown on the inside.":"billie/8f220c5285f4.m4a","Shot clean through the keeper.":"billie/3f435d5c3615.m4a","Nobody walked out of that room.":"billie/7288ac629e5f.m4a","There was a bang about quarter to eleven.":"billie/02a832f057d1.m4a","Everyone thinks gun.":"billie/b1150aa862c7.m4a","I think engine.":"billie/b3c6589485bf.m4a","I know what a backfire sounds like, Inspector.":"billie/411565445024.m4a","A cockpit fire in '29.":"billie/12b062653c08.m4a","I don't talk about it.":"billie/36b8e6b13cee.m4a","And before you ask: no, I don't talk about the Marigold either.":"billie/f83b5134767e.m4a","Get out of my face, Inspector.":"billie/05bc9ed7a7a9.m4a","...Fine.":"billie/453722795a23.m4a","Yes.":"billie/c53acddd6710.m4a","He asked me to run up the Trimotor's engines at night and keep my mouth shut.":"billie/1daff1ac1151.m4a","Said it was a medical charter to Zürich at five.":"billie/f67443ed64d9.m4a","That bang was her engine backfiring.":"billie/3faf516899ec.m4a","I didn't kill him.":"billie/f9a8cba2122b.m4a","I was flying him out.":"billie/258d51675638.m4a","Told you.":"billie/f519d437d2ee.m4a","Backfire.":"billie/a345d86cfd77.m4a","Now can we stop looking at me like I shot him?":"billie/639525ad1422.m4a","Where did you...":"billie/cf2875eda1b1.m4a","All right.":"billie/cb616d289022.m4a","I was meant to fly that plane.":"billie/2afd83a8067f.m4a","I'll tell you about it if you ask me straight.":"billie/213a04e2c338.m4a","That's evidence, is it?":"billie/b70165e09797.m4a","Looks like junk to me.":"billie/a668f7382660.m4a","What do you want to know?":"billie/d6e57d6de941.m4a","Anything else, Inspector?":"billie/0bd81f7dc17c.m4a","Anything else?":"billie/137e3b922f6f.m4a","I'd rather not talk about that.":"billie/7dcfc0f8e066.m4a","Not with you.":"billie/1342b7e96676.m4a","Not yet.":"billie/0024879e4220.m4a","Inspector?":"billie/84ee10552237.m4a","What do you want to show them?":"billie/632f59d99f8d.m4a","You haven't found anything worth showing yet.":"billie/69fa6d2c1d0f.m4a"},"lindqvist":{"Inspector.":"lindqvist/e6c8427027ab.m4a","A terrible business.":"lindqvist/3490898c0269.m4a","His heart, you know.":"lindqvist/9b8127947914.m4a","I warned him for years.":"lindqvist/2d24b62dca1d.m4a","Ah.":"lindqvist/b8f4fe0ec615.m4a","Is there, er, something more?":"lindqvist/a240dcd3c142.m4a","Heart failure.":"lindqvist/b9f1338ecc63.m4a","Almost certainly.":"lindqvist/70aff9d679f6.m4a","He had a weak heart, he drank, he would not rest.":"lindqvist/f9cfaaf6138f.m4a","I examined him at half past six.":"lindqvist/4cf3363d4dfa.m4a","It was... it was his heart.":"lindqvist/dc8417f5487b.m4a","Digitalis.":"lindqvist/e9ea141f2ef0.m4a","Foxglove.":"lindqvist/c53bc3ff4cd5.m4a","A small dose, carefully measured.":"lindqvist/6bb3e30c8dc2.m4a","They did not kill him, if that is what you are thinking.":"lindqvist/842e7f7bfb44.m4a","...Ask me again when you know the whole truth, Inspector.":"lindqvist/e68892ee4882.m4a","Please.":"lindqvist/a491edb9c9b7.m4a","Cyanide.":"lindqvist/a083818e9cce.m4a","Yes.":"lindqvist/bbf9d13724cc.m4a","I smelled it.":"lindqvist/28db4a2e7092.m4a","God forgive me, I smelled it and I said heart failure because I was afraid of what an inquest would find.":"lindqvist/a099f71238e6.m4a","Not who killed him.":"lindqvist/cc744b2dc33a.m4a","What else.":"lindqvist/c2f670932938.m4a","From the decanter.":"lindqvist/de8902865580.m4a","Then anyone could have... anyone who could get into that room.":"lindqvist/06828e7c2db0.m4a","I'm a doctor, Inspector, not a detective.":"lindqvist/a89d7fe62269.m4a","What do you want to know?":"lindqvist/7bb4c7396602.m4a","Anything else, Inspector?":"lindqvist/58474a4a1725.m4a","Anything else?":"lindqvist/5d80293632cf.m4a","I'd rather not talk about that.":"lindqvist/4f08543bc77c.m4a","Not with you.":"lindqvist/0a5d848294a9.m4a","Not yet.":"lindqvist/35618f31b4df.m4a","Inspector?":"lindqvist/480dc8423e05.m4a","What do you want to show them?":"lindqvist/6391c5d43545.m4a","You haven't found anything worth showing yet.":"lindqvist/acb25070e7d6.m4a"},"julian":{"Inspector Hart.":"julian/d8e6e4a83f0a.m4a","How good of you to come.":"julian/c4c5fbd6aa21.m4a","I trust the storm will let us all leave by evening?":"julian/fedf35fb4635.m4a","Inspector.":"julian/7e65475ef8b2.m4a","Always a pleasure.":"julian/b72b6caac5b1.m4a","Cornelius invited me to talk about a merger.":"julian/99314b6981b1.m4a","Our companies have been rivals for a decade.":"julian/888fd1defe44.m4a","Rivals, Inspector, not enemies.":"julian/7f05078f3aa6.m4a","I went to speak with Cornelius at a quarter past eleven.":"julian/e1b406ac521e.m4a","His door was locked and he didn't answer.":"julian/576937f0c07c.m4a","I assumed he'd gone to bed in a sulk.":"julian/45065fade37f.m4a","Then I went to bed myself.":"julian/adad1ebb7dac.m4a","That she was leaving him, and that she deserved to.":"julian/1f535fafa464.m4a","Draw no more conclusions from that than it will bear.":"julian/ba69c8c86979.m4a","Business is business, Inspector.":"julian/43f2fcc827f4.m4a","A signature is ink.":"julian/34f43f4341eb.m4a","Murder is something else.":"julian/9e0270c7227d.m4a","A backfire?":"julian/39a2ed06afcd.m4a","How dull.":"julian/d6eaafe5914d.m4a","I was hoping for something more operatic.":"julian/973f516c485c.m4a","How very interesting.":"julian/bc2862587181.m4a","And what would you like me to say about it?":"julian/0bf7264be368.m4a","What do you want to know?":"julian/dd282a77cf7e.m4a","Anything else, Inspector?":"julian/39de5cddf631.m4a","Anything else?":"julian/b2f6943805ac.m4a","I'd rather not talk about that.":"julian/9700a363f843.m4a","Not with you.":"julian/7365e404eef8.m4a","Not yet.":"julian/685f2b6c8afb.m4a","Inspector?":"julian/3a6487d00f3c.m4a","What do you want to show them?":"julian/0ce9b90edfa0.m4a","You haven't found anything worth showing yet.":"julian/4c339cb45c09.m4a"},"ox":{"...Inspector.":"ox/eaeeea3e6722.m4a","Inspector.":"ox/3e2e2f8a771a.m4a","I've got work.":"ox/6e1876008f1d.m4a","Engines don't fix themselves.":"ox/e3250c5b0d89.m4a","Worked late.":"ox/8143ea70c432.m4a","In the shed.":"ox/6daafd26ee3e.m4a","Went to bed.":"ox/c100e5ee0aba.m4a","That's all.":"ox/d59389a700c6.m4a","I said that's all.":"ox/d36d7a87118d.m4a","Habit.":"ox/ceb44a1145f1.m4a","My mother always set an extra place.":"ox/35fa93861783.m4a","For whoever comes.":"ox/c46e69bc1b02.m4a","Old fuel line.":"ox/e80689f979bd.m4a","Under everything.":"ox/3d6a5de53a17.m4a","I'm not supposed to talk about it.":"ox/8eee80249849.m4a","I did what I was told.":"ox/5b13dbf7a6ae.m4a","Mr.":"ox/274b55584a2b.m4a","Pryce said pass it, so I passed it.":"ox/2bb72caa2266.m4a","Six people, Inspector.":"ox/c85fda86aeeb.m4a","I signed and six people...":"ox/bff203f3045a.m4a","She needs things.":"ox/bb7a94c6fa97.m4a","Ordinary things.":"ox/75e8440b36d4.m4a","A coat.":"ox/080673ea02ce.m4a","Ribbons.":"ox/cc4f943d0173.m4a","I bring them.":"ox/9e9bdc0a3fd2.m4a","That's all I do.":"ox/47eda5dc9d31.m4a","It's only a lamp.":"ox/3d6a57eb2d1d.m4a","She reads by it.":"ox/55e87ff024cb.m4a","Don't take that away.":"ox/4dabd2005a08.m4a","I mean.":"ox/fe5beaf3d237.m4a","Nobody reads down there.":"ox/98abfbf9f4ae.m4a","Don't know nothing about that.":"ox/478848365da6.m4a","What do you want to know?":"ox/f90ada9e6003.m4a","Anything else, Inspector?":"ox/316c4a70083d.m4a","Anything else?":"ox/e8c1ce6f8adb.m4a","I'd rather not talk about that.":"ox/15bc181726c7.m4a","Not with you.":"ox/e22f900c22d5.m4a","Not yet.":"ox/2d7b6c9ef5a1.m4a","Inspector?":"ox/7831f21a2ef6.m4a","What do you want to show them?":"ox/416a636f6c94.m4a","You haven't found anything worth showing yet.":"ox/f67e7804f34b.m4a","Don't come down, Inspector.":"ox/d3b56f0f38c9.m4a","Please.":"ox/55f910b9e4f6.m4a","There's nothing down here.":"ox/fd529d510c11.m4a","His shoulders drop.":"ox/87a13ba88286.m4a","He lowers the wrench, slowly.":"ox/24bde733f6b9.m4a","I can't.":"ox/1977fcce2647.m4a","I promised.":"ox/5837d2c30b94.m4a","Then you know already.":"ox/52ba26e11320.m4a","No.":"ox/70e1d8dd6e47.m4a"},"tamsin":{"Inspector.":"tamsin/d2870e804440.m4a","For the record, I hated him.":"tamsin/209e7fd703e2.m4a","Saves time.":"tamsin/1d8d50e84caf.m4a","What now?":"tamsin/9aab0c71c3e7.m4a","Eleven years of taking dictation from a man who thought 'please' was something other people said.":"tamsin/98a6bb01707d.m4a","I hated him.":"tamsin/03367ffb1d48.m4a","I didn't kill him.":"tamsin/a3b5bfb4a428.m4a","Those are different hobbies.":"tamsin/31d7d6537a0c.m4a","He told me to clear his diary for today.":"tamsin/e35e922bc598.m4a","Said, 'Tomorrow I end it, Quill, and you can type the whole sorry story for the papers.' I thought he meant the merger.":"tamsin/9c2a2d18911b.m4a","I was right behind Billie.":"tamsin/54fe9a86f677.m4a","The bolt was shot from inside.":"tamsin/e85fcdc9e81a.m4a","I'd swear to it.":"tamsin/7fd4bc6f280a.m4a","Nineteen, three, seventeen.":"tamsin/56313f72772e.m4a","Left, right, left.":"tamsin/971c2ec69797.m4a","He made me memorise it in case he dropped dead.":"tamsin/cd8731b5df3c.m4a","Funny.":"tamsin/84a671f6887a.m4a","Me.":"tamsin/1f76b20b6631.m4a","Don't look at me like that.":"tamsin/2a81b2147572.m4a","I only count what I'm told.":"tamsin/3ea0e6cae11d.m4a","One extra, every day, signed by Ox.":"tamsin/b08f67ed31b6.m4a","I assumed he ate it.":"tamsin/695bc6980dba.m4a","Yes.":"tamsin/f0e5d76055e0.m4a","Five hundred a month for the real weather report.":"tamsin/e9f9a65443a2.m4a","Blackmail isn't murder, Inspector.":"tamsin/7cd7f1f9a628.m4a","Dead men don't pay.":"tamsin/4698220d2a03.m4a","End the silence.":"tamsin/7fc9b1910d1e.m4a","So he really meant to do it.":"tamsin/bc0a7f7d7c72.m4a","Well.":"tamsin/d84401276a44.m4a","Somebody decided he wouldn't.":"tamsin/56975c44bf84.m4a","Riveting.":"tamsin/72c4eadf4d06.m4a","What do you want to know?":"tamsin/c8ba665fd948.m4a","Anything else, Inspector?":"tamsin/2c95b42e6073.m4a","Anything else?":"tamsin/826fb6956c1f.m4a","I'd rather not talk about that.":"tamsin/12e1c736d7c4.m4a","Not with you.":"tamsin/610b6d9b3b22.m4a","Not yet.":"tamsin/4e528c8ecbd7.m4a","Inspector?":"tamsin/44a94142602b.m4a","What do you want to show them?":"tamsin/e2e4ff250010.m4a","You haven't found anything worth showing yet.":"tamsin/921ffdf79cfe.m4a"},"clementine":{"Let him through, Ox.":"clementine/067afa1d5801.m4a","You're later than I hoped, Inspector.":"clementine/79e86a82dcc3.m4a","Yes.":"clementine/eaf7d81f1ef3.m4a","The girl who died on the Marigold.":"clementine/9f185ccee713.m4a","Sit down, if you like.":"clementine/072b31ecd4c9.m4a","Then tell me what you know.":"clementine/e0d5097bf722.m4a","Not what you think.":"clementine/8e4c8b7be4f9.m4a","What you know.":"clementine/9c831de18693.m4a","That isn't it.":"clementine/51709e8e5f04.m4a","You don't know.":"clementine/93f7367fcb7b.m4a","Not really.":"clementine/5c3746e0f44c.m4a","Come back when you do, Inspector.":"clementine/94b3798315a9.m4a","I'm not going anywhere.":"clementine/036c2c6082f9.m4a","That was rather the point.":"clementine/8bf253465170.m4a","So.":"clementine/c3c1ce3cc841.m4a","What happens now, Inspector?":"clementine/8ccdc4753d90.m4a","I kept that poison for myself.":"clementine/e026ac05fafa.m4a","Eleven months, in a tin, under the bed.":"clementine/45fa1152f8cc.m4a","Then I heard him say 'Zürich', and I decided who it was for.":"clementine/ca0fcc536cdf.m4a","I put it in the decanter that afternoon, from below.":"clementine/b1830233d5a4.m4a","At twenty to ten he drank to Marigold, the way he always did.":"clementine/194c6d63906d.m4a","I listened until it was quiet.":"clementine/d916d82f6401.m4a","Then I went up and wound my music box, because I didn't know what else to do.":"clementine/9df1f0ef247c.m4a","I didn't send for you to catch me, Inspector.":"clementine/a6a394ec076b.m4a","I sent for you to find me.":"clementine/a6644bb947e3.m4a","I didn't know yet that I would do the other thing.":"clementine/f0cf3325a65c.m4a","He knew the mount was cracked.":"clementine/5a1222bbb102.m4a","He knew about the weather.":"clementine/6048f9d683bc.m4a","He carried me out of the fire whispering 'don't tell them you were aboard'.":"clementine/f2388fc01f33.m4a","Not because he was ashamed.":"clementine/001fcef0a444.m4a","Because I was proof.":"clementine/3969a1c62b30.m4a","You brought a boy with you.":"clementine/5316b59179fa.m4a","The one who talks to himself in the shed.":"clementine/e7619bb8fd7b.m4a","Look after him.":"clementine/399536dc212e.m4a","Everyone says it was his heart.":"clementine/4feeaffaf167.m4a","No.":"clementine/a7be82ce33c3.m4a","It wasn't.":"clementine/474c14eac029.m4a","The door was bolted.":"clementine/9014ffeca512.m4a","He was alone.":"clementine/8d2894a43d24.m4a","I wound it for him.":"clementine/91c851b7832b.m4a","He used to wind it for me.":"clementine/57ed9948db0d.m4a","Anyone could have touched that decanter.":"clementine/efc1cc09dab3.m4a","She looks at her gloved hands and says nothing.":"clementine/90bba352dd1a.m4a","And you think you know who sent for you.":"clementine/79f2a27e7d93.m4a","The man upstairs stumbles on his Q.":"clementine/cc2d4eb9449f.m4a","I copied him.":"clementine/bb3c9f6159e5.m4a","It seemed polite.":"clementine/b5ee5c0d3860.m4a","I died, Inspector.":"clementine/121e72b5cce0.m4a","It was in the papers.":"clementine/42f67c5c53a4.m4a","He got there before anyone.":"clementine/a25d5c01ea46.m4a","He carried me out himself.":"clementine/93399f1fe749.m4a","And how would a dead girl get into a locked room?":"clementine/e231df3af772.m4a","The same way I get everywhere.":"clementine/d6ee1600af7b.m4a"},"cylinder":{"Daddy, I can see the ridge!":"cylinder/f9d5a638c517.m4a"}}}